OL,3,GNEWSA'TV and cheap booze' blamed for
OL,4,Alandlord quitting
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer pub landlord Patrick Hughes is
OL,7,Fblunt when explaining why he has called
OL,8,Ftime on his tenure behind the bar.
OL,10,F"I thought there was a gap in the
OL,11,Fmarket but there was no market for the
OL,12,Fgap", he said.
OL,14,FThe 66-year-old took over The Royal
OL,15,FMail Cart pub in Spalding, in August
OL,16,F2025, hoping to attract customers with
OL,17,Flive music nights and "a sense of
OL,18,Fcommunity".
